  "slug": "legalzoom",
  "name": "Legalzoom",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Attorney guidance and legal tools for business and personal needs. AI-powered document review identifies critical risks and important clauses, advises when to engage an attorney, and routes to LegalZoom's network when professional expertise is needed.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `attorney-assist` (Connects the user with a LegalZoom attorney for legal consultation)\n- **Commands** (1): `review-contract` (In-depth contract analysis with risk assessment and attorney review recommendations)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `legalzoom`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install legalzoom@claude-plugins-official` from `legalzoom/claude-plugins` (`plugins/legalzoom`).",
